msgid "Training Batches & Modules"
msgstr "Angkatan & Modul Pelatihan"

msgid "Group trainees into batches and enrol them in training modules (language, skills, culture)."
msgstr "Kelompokkan trainee ke dalam angkatan dan daftarkan ke modul pelatihan (bahasa, keterampilan, budaya)."

msgid "Daily & Test Scores"
msgstr "Nilai Harian & Ujian"

msgid "Record daily scores and periodic competency test results to track each trainee's progress."
msgstr "Catat nilai harian dan hasil uji kompetensi berkala untuk memantau kemajuan tiap trainee."

msgid "Promote → Apprentice"
msgstr "Promosikan → Pemagang"

msgid "Trainees who pass candidate + training checks are promoted to Apprentice, ready for departure."
msgstr "Trainee yang lolos pemeriksaan kandidat + pelatihan dipromosikan menjadi Pemagang, siap berangkat."

msgid "Documentation & Departure to Japan"
msgstr "Dokumentasi & Keberangkatan ke Jepang"

msgid "Prepare Certificate of Eligibility, visa, passport and pre-departure medical records for each apprentice."
msgstr "Siapkan Certificate of Eligibility, visa, paspor, dan rekam medis prakeberangkatan untuk tiap pemagang."

msgid "Ticketing & Flights"
msgstr "Tiket & Penerbangan"

msgid "Arrange flights, transit legs and departure schedules."
msgstr "Atur penerbangan, segmen transit, dan jadwal keberangkatan."

msgid "Costs & Installments"
msgstr "Biaya & Angsuran"

msgid "Record document costs and manage trainee installment payments and receipts."
msgstr "Catat biaya dokumen serta kelola pembayaran angsuran dan kuitansi trainee."

msgid "Apprenticeship in Japan → Return Home"
msgstr "Pemagangan di Jepang → Kepulangan"

msgid "Track apprentices during their placement in Japan, including kaizen / problem-solving stories."
msgstr "Pantau pemagang selama penempatan di Jepang, termasuk cerita kaizen / penyelesaian masalah."

msgid "Post-Apprentice — Return to Indonesia"
msgstr "Pasca-Pemagangan — Kembali ke Indonesia"

msgid "When the programme ends and the apprentice returns home, track their alumni status (employed, self-employed, continuing study…)."
msgstr "Ketika program berakhir dan pemagang pulang, pantau status alumninya (bekerja, wirausaha, melanjutkan studi…)."

msgid "Dashboards & Reports"
msgstr "Dasbor & Laporan"

msgid "Management monitors the whole pipeline through department dashboards and reports at any time."
msgstr "Manajemen memantau seluruh alur melalui dasbor departemen dan laporan kapan saja."

msgid "For developers / debuggers"
msgstr "Untuk pengembang / penelusuran masalah"

msgid "The pipeline spans 15 dedicated databases (cms_*). Stakeholders live in"
msgstr "Alur ini tersebar di 15 basis data khusus (cms_*). Pemangku kepentingan berada di"

